      "value": "<p>The Arc Projector fires a bolt of concentrated electromagnetic energy that ionizes the air between weapon and target, creating a conductive channel through which subsequent lightning arcs jump from enemy to enemy. A single shot can incapacitate an entire cluster of targets in rapid succession, bypassing their kinetic barriers entirely. Cerberus developed it for anti-Geth operations, where its chain lightning effect is most visible — and most lethal.</p>"
